# hole.scene -- A picture with a clear hole in front of the cube
# Copyright (c) 2026 Jakob Kastelic

# The picture (a PAM file of three by three pixels, all white but the
# clear one in the middle, written by test/run.sh) stands 5 mm in front of
# the cube of test/cube.obj, over all of its front.
mesh cube cube.obj colour 0.8 0.1 0.1
image window ../build/hole.pam 0 -5 0 50 -5 0 0 -5 50
view front
